From 9549fd2a23f584a02fdccf7c3fc0a17d9ef8fa46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:28:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] api tests: anchor sample history to today instead of July
 2026

The coach payload only reads the last 12 weeks, so the fixed 2026-07-20
sample workout fell out of the window around 2026-10-12 and ten tests
started failing. Dates are now offsets from a week before today.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R8FuUGtA5Mu78NDpeAsnqt
